    "verifyText": {
      "id": "lf_help_0",
      "value": "This tool provides a breakdown of how your retirement account(s) will be used - including withdrawals, interest received, taxes and penalties - from the start of retirement until death. Here are some tips to help you ensure that estimated expenses during retirement will be covered:"
